    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Smol Kobold Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smol Kobold Garden is a cozy yet deep creature raising game where you collect, breed, and train adorable little kobolds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Ever Changing Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your dream garden by changing the terrain and ecosystem to attract new creatures and uncover hidden species.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>  <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Raise and Breed</strong> unique kobolds with different colors, shapes, patterns and personality traits.</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Good or Evil?</strong> The way you care influences your kobolds attitude and how they grow over time!</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Mini-games and Competitions.</strong> Earn items, medals, and upgrades in a variety of smaller games.</li></ul><br>Will you create the ultimate life form? Start your garden today!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Smol Kobold Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smol Kobold Garden is a cozy yet deep creature raising game where you collect, breed, and train adorable little kobolds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Ever Changing Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your dream garden by changing the terrain and ecosystem to attract new creatures and uncover hidden species.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>  <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Raise and Breed</strong> unique kobolds with different colors, shapes, patterns and personality traits.</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Good or Evil?</strong> The way you care influences your kobolds attitude and how they grow over time!</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Mini-games and Competitions.</strong> Earn items, medals, and upgrades in a variety of smaller games.</li></ul><br>Will you create the ultimate life form? Start your garden today!</p>",
    "short_description": "Collect, breed, and train small creatures known as kobolds. Expand your garden and compete in a variety of mini-games in a cozy creature raising game.",
